# 2026-08-10: a checkpoint commit had ~5GB of training-feature CSVs and embedding
# .npy files under data/ensemble/ that made push fail outright. Trained model
# artifacts (.pkl) stay tracked; regenerable feature/embedding dumps do not.
data/ensemble/**/*.csv
data/ensemble/**/*.npy

